00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:08.463
So wait, speaking of holidays,

00:02:08.463 --> 00:02:11.710
weren't you once banned
from all Holiday Inns.

00:02:11.710 --> 00:02:13.390
'Cause I find this very rock and roll.

00:02:13.390 --> 00:02:14.400
- Oh yeah, there's a-.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:15.500
