00:02:40.205 --> 00:02:41.133
- Oh my God.

00:02:41.133 --> 00:02:43.260
- When the faces of Fleetwood
Mac was still coming up.

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:44.800
- Oh my god, that's amazing.

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:47.368
