the songs on the album.

00:02:58.570 --> 00:03:00.610
And it is to point out that men,

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:02.860
strong men, tough man can cry.

00:03:02.860 --> 00:03:04.470
- Absolutely.

00:03:04.470 --> 00:03:06.890
