00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:10.470
- Well, you know when you
split up with the girlfriend.

00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:11.303
- Yes.

00:03:11.303 --> 00:03:12.136
Well, no but-.

00:03:12.136 --> 00:03:13.064
